<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-047" chapter-id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages" source-id="s-songshu-047-meng-family-passages-ws2190557">
  <p id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p001:m0000" ref="zuf_v5v_18s">孟懷玉</persName>，平昌安丘人也。高祖<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p001:m0013" ref="3ut_u0d_j6w">珩</persName>，晉河南尹。祖<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p001:m0021" ref="3ut_u0d_j6w_*A">淵</persName>，右光祿大夫。父<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p001:m0030" ref="3ut_u0d_j6w_*AA">綽</persName>，義旗後為給事中，光祿勳，追贈金紫光祿大夫。世居京口。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">丁父艱，<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p002:m0004" ref="zuf_v5v_18s">懷玉</persName>有孝性，因抱篤疾，上表陳解，不許。又自陳弟<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p002:m0027" ref="3ut_u0d_j6w_*AAB">仙客</persName>出繼，喪主唯己，乃見聽。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">子<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p003:m0001" ref="zuf_v5v_18s_A">元</persName>卒，無子，國除。<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p003:m0010" ref="zuf_v5v_18s">懷玉</persName>別封陽豐男，子<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p003:m0019" ref="zuf_v5v_18s_B">慧熙</persName>嗣，坐廢祭祀奪爵。<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p003:m0030" ref="zuf_v5v_18s_B">慧熙</persName>子<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p003:m0033" ref="6s5_hh6_zh8">宗嗣</persName>，竟陵太守，中大夫。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p004:m0000" ref="3ut_u0d_j6w_*AAA">龍符</persName>，<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p004:m0003" ref="zuf_v5v_18s">懷玉</persName>弟也。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p005" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">無子，弟<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p005:m0004" ref="3ut_u0d_j6w_*AAB">仙客</persName>以子<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p005:m0008" ref="3ut_u0d_j6w_*AABA">微生</persName>嗣封。太祖元嘉中，有罪奪爵，徙廣州。以<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p005:m0029" ref="3ut_u0d_j6w_*AABA">微生</persName>弟<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p005:m0032" ref="3ut_u0d_j6w_*AABB">彥祖</persName>子<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p005:m0035" ref="3ut_u0d_j6w_*AABBA">佛護</persName>襲爵。齊受禪，國除。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p006" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">孝武大明初，諸流徙者悉聽還本，<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p006:m0015" ref="3ut_u0d_j6w_*AABA">微生</persName>已死，子<persName id="c-songshu-047-meng-family-passages:p006:m0021" ref="3ut_u0d_j6w_*AABAA">係祖</persName>歸京都，有筋榦異力，能儋負數人。</p>
</text>
